    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_4_e1",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_5",
      "quote": "This systematic review aims to address the following PIO question: 'What is the effect of social media on prevention and promotion of oral health compared with conventional strategies among lay people of any age without disability or systematic diseases?'",
      "reason": "The review explicitly states its objective using a PIO (Population, Intervention, Outcome) framework."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_4_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_5",
      "quote": "This systematic review aims to address the following PIO question: 'What is the effect of social media on prevention and promotion of oral health compared with conventional strategies among lay people of any age without disability or systematic diseases?'. The review encompasses (P) laypeople from diverse backgrounds... The focus is on (I) social media-based interventions... The desired outcomes include (O) any changes in oral health status, knowledge, beliefs, and attitudes...",
      "reason": "The review is of intervention effects and explicitly states the planned comparisons and components using a PIO framework."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 100
