      "reason": "The manuscript specifies the dissemination year range (2012-2023), language restriction (English), and publication status/type exclusions (conference proceedings, editorials, etc.)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e3",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "There is no evidence that the review excluded studies specifically because outcomes were not measured versus not reported; this is a conditional requirement that does not apply here."
    },
    {
